00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.900
A bunny!

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.940
Nuh-uh! That's a fishy!

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.870
That time we spent together
waiting colored in the sunset

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:42.290
was so much fun, and we felt so safe.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.750
I feel sick...

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.840
Shall we take a break?

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.000
Yes, please...

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.550
Are you okay, Hiyori-<i>chan</i>?

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:55.510
Y-Yeah...

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:59.100
Did this mountain pass
always make me this sick?

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.770
Do you want some tea?

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.600
Thanks... I guess you're not affected.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.650
I've been playing a game
on my phone and I'm totally fine!

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.860
Just thinking about that
makes me feel sick.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.070
Koharu, you can get a full view
of the lake from here.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.070
Ooh, I wanna see.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.410
Wow... It's so pretty!

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.620
Yeah.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.540
No wonder they call it
the Lake of the Heavens.

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.750
It has such a cool nickname?!

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.670
Oh, someone's already fishing.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:40.720
I'm sure people who came here for that
in the morning came here around five.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.850
L-Let's go.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.480
Feeling better already?

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.440
No, but let's just go!

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.310
All right!

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:53.070
Let's start this all-girl fishing,
leaf-picking, and camping trip!

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.280
That's way too long.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:12.710
<i>I had dropped something important</i>
<i>and even though I didn't know you,</i>

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:18.260
<i>You had found it and brought it back</i>
<i>to me unexpectedly this morning</i>

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:24.010
<i>Oh yeah, I was always told to</i>
<i>write my name on important things</i>

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:29.770
<i>Or I might end up losing them somewhere</i>

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.730
<i>It's not (anyone's fault)</i>

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.440
<i>It's not (like it belongs to anyone else)</i>

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:40.660
<i>The world will always be right there</i>

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.370
<i>Let the wind (take you by the hand)</i>

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.160
<i>And the sky (now, breathe together)</i>

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.830
<i>And let's go (it's now begun to move)</i>

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.000
<i>The arrow in our hearts</i>

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.920
<i>If I'm (yes, if I'm with you)</i>

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:58.300
<i>With you (yes, because I'm with you)</i>

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:08.480
<i>We still don't know what's going to</i>
<i>happen in this future that's moving forward</i>

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:13.190
<i>And bouncing glitteringly</i>

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.000
"Episode 11"
"Those Important to Me"

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.630
Everyone else is already here.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.840
Hiyori!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.300
We already checked in, so all of you girls

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.510
who are going to fish just need
to go buy your fishing tickets.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.100
Let's go, Futaba.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.640
Okay!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:52.440
"Adult Fishing Ticket" "Children Fishing Ticket"

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:53.770
"Adult Fishing Ticket" "Children Fishing Ticket"
Hiyori...

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:54.150
"Fishing Tickets"
Hiyori...

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.480
"Fishing Tickets"
