00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.250
That's good. I'm sure you'll catch lots.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:16.080
Wha... What is that... thing?!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.590
We can't go any closer
to the campsite with our car,

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.090
