00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.430
I wanna pull it! Let me, let me!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.180
How old are you again?

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.350
Pa!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.390
Oh, I know what that's from!

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.310
And now, we have
the child pulling the wagon.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.650
I proclaim this the site of our all-girl
fishing, leaf-picking, and camping trip!

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.360
Again, shorten that.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:48.580
We'll get things set up,
so you kids run off and play.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.950
Okay!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.000
You can go, too, Koi.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.330
Okay.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.580
Have fun!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:56.830
Be careful.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.340
We'll see you later.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.210
We'll make sure to catch lots!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.800
See you later!

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.420
Be careful out there!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:08.640
Now, then... Why don't we toast with
some beers before we get started?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.810
You're a terrible adult.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:17.190
Aiko, the ground is pretty muddy,
so don't get too close to the shore.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.730
I'll be fine!

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.860
I'll be keeping my eye out--
I'll be watching from here!

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.990
I see. Okay, let's go, Futaba-<i>chan</i>.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.400
Okay!

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:34.580
You don't need to go with Yamahi, Koharu?
You think you can fish on your own?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:38.080
Now, don't underestimate me, Koi.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.590
I'm now a pro fly-fishing woman!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:46.720
I'll just get this fly attached in a snap!

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.260
Attached in a snap...

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.550
Sna...

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.350
Koi!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.310
