Do you know a way to tie
each kind of line together?

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:06.880
There are so many and they're all
difficult, so I can't remember them all!

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:12.430
I admire your honesty.
Then I'll show you the easiest one.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:15.220
Koi, you're a saint!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.100
First, line up your two lines
and create a loop.

